### META
directory_path: testsuite/module_cli
description: CLI testing module for DINS command-line tools per PART5
created: 2025-01-28
modified: 2025-01-28
status: active

### FILES
test_module_cli.py | Main CLI test module with run_tests() function
README.md | Module documentation and usage instructions

### TESTS
test_dinser_exists | Verifies dinser CLI exists and is executable
test_dinser_help | Validates help command output
test_dinser_version | Validates version command output
test_dinser_status | Tests status command execution
test_dinser_no_args | Tests behavior with no arguments
test_dinser_invalid_command | Tests graceful error handling
test_dinser_webui_help | Tests webui subcommand
test_cli_scripts_executable | Verifies script permissions
test_setup_sh_help | Tests setup.sh help
test_webui_sh_help | Tests webui.sh help

### DEPENDENCIES
testsuite.py | Main test suite framework
subprocess | Python subprocess module for CLI execution

### NOTES
All tests are non-destructive per PART5 specification.
Tests validate CLI behavior without executing installation operations.
